gantt
  title Evidence Review Release
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat %b %d
  tickInterval 1day
  excludes weekends
  todayMarker off

  section Intake
    Fixture set frozen      :milestone, freeze, 2026-01-05, 0d
    Collect evidence        :done, collect, 2026-01-05, 3d
    Normalize sources       :done, normalize, after collect, 2d

  section Review
    Primary review          :active, review, 2026-01-07, 5d
    Independent checks      :checks, 2026-01-08, 4d
    Resolve findings        :crit, resolve, after review checks, 3d

  section Delivery
    Draft retained report   :draft, after resolve, 2d
    Sign-off complete       :milestone, signoff, after draft, 0d
